~ Basler Evetar M12B1618, 16 mm f/1.8 with a 1/2 inch image circle, in the variant without an IR-cut filter (order number 2000036374) [@Basler-M12B1618]. A lens with the filter would block the 850 nm illumination. The specification does not state transmission at 850 nm or mass, so the defaults in `lens.on` stay.

